      "message": "It\u0027s not necessary. It\u0027s only returned if tpm_reset() gets a TPM_EVENT_RESET event from tpm_reset_now(), and that can only happen after it\u0027s set to the correct value.\n\nPlus, EC_SUCCESS is zero. gcc used to complain about initializing globals to zero. Clang doesn\u0027t seem to.",
